# =============================================================================
# What must NOT be uploaded to Vercel.
#
# Created 2026-08-03 because `vercel deploy` failed with "File size limit
# exceeded (100 MB)": with no git remote on this project the CLI uploads the
# working directory, and that swept in a local Chrome-for-Testing binary.
#
# 🔴 EVERY ENTRY HERE IS EITHER A LOCAL TOOL OR AN UNREFERENCED SOURCE ASSET.
# Nothing the site actually serves is excluded — verified by grepping the app
# for each path before adding it. Excluding a referenced asset would 404 an
# image in production, which is exactly the class of "visible change" this pass
# is forbidden from making.
# =============================================================================

# --- 🔴 LOCAL ENV FILES. THIS ENTRY IS A SAFETY INTERLOCK, NOT TIDINESS. ---
# `.vercelignore` REPLACES `.gitignore` for upload purposes — the moment this
# file exists, Vercel stops consulting `.gitignore`, so every `.env*.local`
# that git has been quietly ignoring becomes an UPLOADED file. Next.js then
# reads it during the Vercel build, where it silently outranks the project's
# own Environment Variables. A local placeholder or a stale key would ship to
# production and break auth with a green build and no error anywhere.
# Environment values belong in the Vercel project settings. Never in an upload.
.env
.env.local
.env*.local
*.env.txt
.env.local.txt

# --- local tooling, never part of the site ---
chrome/
lighthouse-reports/
node_modules
.next
.next-*

# --- ORIGINAL CAMERA/WHATSAPP FILES, kept in the repo as sources ---
# Nothing in app/, components/ or lib/ references "New folder" — the frames the
# site uses were copied out into public/synergy/ (e.g. join-hero-team-2026.jpg).
# This directory alone is ~26 MB including a 17.5 MB RULA SPEAKING.jpg.
public/New folder/

# --- unreferenced gallery duplicates ---
# "blog gallery" (with a space) is referenced by NOTHING; the site reads
# public/blog-gallery/ (hyphenated). Same story for the spaced variants.
public/blog gallery/

# --- archives ---
*.zip
